    {
      "path": "src/persistence/export-snapshot.ts",
      "content": "Opening a nonexistent database without an upgrade handler creates and persists an empty database. Thus an export of a source that was deleted (or an incorrect name) returns `ReadFailed` but leaves a newly created database behind, despite being a readonly operation. Abort the opening transaction in `onupgradeneeded` so missing sources fail without creating persistent state.",
      "existing_code": "      const open = indexedDB.open(databaseName);\n      open.onsuccess = () =\u003e resolve(open.result);",
      "start_line": 52,
